  - int8-quantization
  - edge-ai
  - rtos
  - nsl-kdd
  - unsw-nb15
abstract: >-
  First publicly documented deployment of an SNN-equivalent IDS
  on an ARM Cortex-M NPU. Evaluated on NSL-KDD (5-class) and
  UNSW-NB15 (10-class) with 10 seeds, achieving 0.29-0.46ms
  inference (2.7-4.2x faster than CPU) on the STM32N6570-DK
  Neural-ART NPU, with 120-138 KB Flash and 0.5-1.25 KB RAM.
